    "title": "Changing feelings or alternative choices",
    "subtitle": "Learn, understand, and use a Mandarin pattern.",
    "context": "Use the introduced pattern in a bounded sentence. Other wording may be valid Chinese; this task checks this pattern and these words.",
    "steps": [
      {
        "id": "EX-GRAM-G-hsk6-parallel-teach",
        "kind": "teach",
        "title": "Changing feelings or alternative choices",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "text": "Paired time expressions describe alternating states. Paired choice expressions instead offer alternatives; they do not claim that the speaker alternates between performing both.",
            "examples": [
              {
                "text": "他一时想去，一时又不想去。",
                "pinyin": "tā yīshí xiǎng qù ， yīshí yòu bù xiǎng qù 。",
                "meaning": "One moment he wants to go; the next he does not.",
                "audio": "301c7f0fe4957f6d7610e838f9ead8044fd5d90580e79a47092dca43dc9da864"
              },
              {
                "text": "要么今天去，要么明天去。",
                "pinyin": "yàome jīntiān qù ， yàome míngtiān qù 。",
                "meaning": "Either go today or go tomorrow.",
                "audio": "4e5c6e008f75ff9a57d06012e885cf0b7e88438032244d49fe92f6256cb8c983"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "title": "Words used in this pattern",
            "examples": [
              {
                "text": "一时",
                "pinyin": "yīshí",
                "meaning": "a period of time; a while",
                "singleWord": true,
                "audio": "299cb21650884aaedc4d979e15ba51a3abb7acfb28eeeabe3729b33c81054201"
              },
              {
                "text": "要么",
                "pinyin": "yàome",
                "meaning": "or; either one or the other",
                "singleWord": true,
                "audio": "ded474b2664ff86715212ef9feedc63ff5538cac472f75b0d40be666dc877a7d"
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
